Rebalance_childToParent_CcipFork
├── given the active strategy is Arbitrum or Polygon Aave V3
├── and TVL exists in the child strategy
├── when CRE initiates rebalance through Parent WorkflowRouter
├── and CRE executes rebalance through Arbitrum or Polygon Child WorkflowRouter
├── then ChildVault should withdraw all TVL from Arbitrum or Polygon Aave V3
├── and ChildVault should send the TVL to Base through local CCIP
├── and ParentVault should deposit the TVL into Base Aave V3
├── then ParentVault should finalize the rebalance
├── and ParentVault should increment the rebalance nonce
└── and the active strategy should be Base Aave V3
